<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A0.F14.9" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Fig. 14</span>: </span><span id="A0.F14.10" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Closed-loop real-vehicle testing results. Each row contains representative frames from the scenario.</span></figcaption>
