<figure id="A0.SS1.fig1" class="ltx_figure">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A0.SS1.fig1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">TABLE III</span>: </span><span id="A0.SS1.fig1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">The mutual conversions of diffusion quantities. The predicted quantities are distinguished with <math id="A0.SS1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\hat{}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mover accent="true"><mphantom></mphantom><mo mathsize="1.110em">^</mo></mover><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\hat{}</annotation></semantics></math> and the model is parameterized with <math id="A0.SS1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>θ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></figcaption>
<div id="A0.SS1.fig1.3" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:359.7pt;height:49.2pt;vertical-align:-22.1pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(0.0pt,0.0pt) scale(1.0,1.0) ;">
